    "text": "By John Mali ,\n1 hours ago Creating a productive environment for crops depends on more than choosing the right plants. The design of the space plays a key role in how well crops grow and how much yield they produce. Thoughtful planning helps balance light, temperature, water, and airflow, ensuring that crops remain healthy through each growth stage. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
